"description":"Kick off the 2026 college football and NFL season with Bleacher Report — from live scores, breaking NFL news, and fantasy football mock draft tools. Stay connected to your teams, players, and the biggest storylines of the season. \n\nIt's draft season, so get ahead of your fantasy football league with expert rankings, sleeper picks, and injury updates before kickoff. Real-time NFL news, roster moves, and preseason storylines, all in one app to help you dominate your draft and your season. \n\nUp your sports fandom with the Bleacher Report app – fast sports scores, alerts, and exclusive content covering all your favorite teams. Beyond scoreboard updates and general sports news, the B/R app is the destination to share your hottest takes and watch the next voices in sports & culture with exclusive Bleacher Report shows and content. Scroll through your favorite sports highlights, videos, articles, community posts, and more with the B/R app. \n\nSports news shows, live sports scores, stats, & epic highlights of all your favorite sports teams. Get sports news alerts instantly, as stories break across the NBA, NHL, NFL, MLB, WNBA, MLS soccer, college sports like NCAA basketball & all-world soccer teams from La Liga, Bundesliga & more. \n\nGet sports news alerts & flash notifications on the latest rumors, trades, stats, predictions & breaking stories for all the sports you love: live NBA playoff scores, NHL playoff alerts, NBA highlights, NHL highlights, real-time game analysis, NFL news, MLB highlights, WNBA, MLS, NCAA basketball, & more. \n\nPick your favorite teams, & instantly get the latest sports news alerts, scores, & more personalized stats through a singular sports app designed for you! \n \nNFL News Alerts, Full Game Recaps, Scores & Updates \n• NFL News instantly: Stay up to date on the latest NFL football news, trades, cuts & signings from the NFL offseason \n• Get full game recaps and videos of the biggest NFL highlights and results from every NFL game \n• Follow your team’s every move for fantasy football or for fandom! \n• Get all the NFL news, stats, scores & recaps, everything your fantasy football team needs to dominate your league \n\nNCAA College Sports \n• From college to pro, all the college sports you love in one sports app \n• NCAA basketball news & college basketball updates for every team following March Madness \n• College football news: Stay up to date on the latest NCAA football transfers, CFB scores, hires, & more during the off-season \n\nSoccer \n• Stay up to date on World Cup 2026 coverage, including breaking news, match updates, and exclusive content as the tournament kicks off \n• Get the latest soccer news, scores & alerts for your teams & favorite players  \n• Live scores & epic highlights for MLS, Premier League, UEFA Champions League, Europa League, La Liga & Bundesliga matches \n\nNBA Alerts, NBA Highlights, Basketball Stats, & NBA Draft News \n• Follow the NBA Finals with live NBA stats and scores \n• Never miss a moment with the latest NBA news coverage, game recaps, and series analysis and updates \n• Exclusive NBA Draft updates, basketball stats, League articles, & rankings \n• Instant NBA stats & highlights from your favorite teams \n\nNHL Alerts, News, and Stats \n• Get instant NHL alerts, developing stories, and highlights \n• Follow the Stanley Cup Final with live scores, series updates, and game-winning moments \n• Keep up with the latest NHL news, storylines, expert analysis & more ahead of the NHL Draft \n\nMLB Scores, Alerts & MLB Highlights \n• Keep track of all the latest updates with instant MLB Alerts during the off-season \n• MLB trade rumors, standings, and updates from regular season through playoffs \n• Follow your favorite MLB teams and never miss an MLB highlight \n\nFan easier, fan better & fan faster with Bleacher Report with instant sports news. All your sports in one place!", "minimumOsVersion":"16.0", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.60219000000000