"description":"From your first draft pick to championship week, dominate every moment of your fantasy football and fantasy baseball season with the FantasyPros app.\n\nDraft Wizard® and My Playbook unite in one seamless app, giving you expert fantasy advice the instant you need it.\n\nWHY YOU’LL WIN\n\nFull Season Edge\nDraft your team and optimize your lineup every single week with custom advice from the most accurate fantasy experts.\n\nAll Your Leagues - All In One Place\nSync your leagues from over 15 hosts* and conveniently manage them all from a single app.\n\nAward Winning Tools\nDraft like a pro, set winning lineups, crush the waiver wire, and negotiate trades with tools trusted by millions.\n\nAccurate Player Rankings\nDynasty, draft, season and weekly advice powered by 100+ experts in our Expert Consensus Rankings (ECR).\n\nQuick Access to Stats & Projections\nTimely research and reports for every player, in one convenient spot.\n\nBreaking News and Alerts\nStay on top of the latest NFL and MLB player news and get instant notifications for your players.\n\n* League sync supports Yahoo, Sleeper, ESPN, CBS Sports, NFL.com, MyFantasyLeague, RT Sports, FleaFlicker, Fantrax, NFC, FFPC, FFWC, FanStar, DataForceFF, Reality Sports Online, and LeagueTycoon.\n\nIntroducing Coach AI\nYour own personal fantasy assistant and expert who knows your league and team better than you do.\n\nMY PLAYBOOK FEATURES\n\n- Start/Sit Assistant: See what your optimal lineup is each week based on the most accurate experts.\n- Waiver Assistant: Find top suggested players to add and drop with in-depth analysis.\n- Trade Assistant: Analyze suggested and offered trades for smarter trade decisions.\n- League Analyzer: See how your team stacks up against your league.\n- Who Should I Start?: Easily compare players side-by-side for smart lineup decisions.\n- Game Day: Real-time fantasy football feed, leaderboard, and league matchups with live fantasy scoring for your teams.\n- Scores & Plays: Live NFL scoreboard, play-by-play, team and player stats, betting odds, and more.\n\nDRAFT WIZARD FEATURES\n\n- Mock Draft Simulator™: Fast and realistic mock draft simulations and draft grades based on your league settings.\n- Expert Suggestions: See who the experts would draft for every single pick.\n- Cheat Sheets: Create custom draft cheat sheets based on expert rankings and ADP.\n- Draft Assistant: Sync with your live draft to get real-time pick suggestions for every round *\n- Custom Drafts: Configure league settings, scoring (Standard, Half PPR, PPR), teams, positions and more.\n- Keeper Leagues: Track keepers for each team so you can mock draft with settings that are close to the real thing.\n\n* Draft Assistant Notes:\n1. Draft Assistant supports the following league hosts: Yahoo, Sleeper, CBS, NFL.com, MyFantasyLeague, RT Sports, Fantrax, and NFFC.\n2. ESPN leagues can be imported into the app, but only the Manual Draft Assistant is supported. Use our browser extensions on web for ESPN live sync support.\n3. Salary Cap Draft Assistant is not available in the app.\n\n----------\n\nIndustry Awards include: Best Service/Tool, Most Accurate Projections, Most Innovative Product, and more.\n\nUpgrade to FantasyPros Premium and unlock powerful draft and in-season features for all sports. Subscriptions auto-renew; manage anytime in Settings.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.fantasypros.com/about/privacy/ \nTerms of Use: https://www.fantasypros.com/about/legal/ \n\nHave feedback or need help? https://support.fantasypros.com \n\nFollow us for ongoing fantasy football advice, articles, podcasts, and more:\n- X: https://www.twitter.com/fantasypros\n- Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/fantasypros/\n- TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@fantasypros\n- YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/fantasypros", "minimumOsVersion":"18.0", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.78742000000000000881072992342524230480194091796875, "sellerUrl":"https://www.fantasypros.com", "bundleId":"com.fantasypros.mpb-nfl-2016", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"339170304", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":85270, "trackContentRating":"4+", "trackCensoredName":"FantasyPros - Fantasy Advice", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/fantasypros-fantasy-advice/id1141119371?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.78742000000000000881072992342524230480194091796875, "userRatingCount":85270}, 
