"releaseNotes":"• Game Analysis: QB matchups, key position battles, X-factors, and sharp pre-game takes before every kickoff\n• Injury Reports: Who's in, who's out, and what it actually means for Sunday's game\n• New alerts for game recaps and pregame analysis - get notified the moment they're ready. Plus a refreshed notifications UI.", "version":"8.5.3", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"All 32 teams, all season, with lightning-fast NFL scores, live play-by-play, instant alerts, schedules, standings, injuries, and the stats that actually matter. All the essentials, all in one place.\n\nYou can also go beyond the box score with pregame analysis, quarterback matchups, trench battles, win probabilities, odds insights, weather impact and game recaps.\n\nScores, Play-by-Play and Alerts\n• Lightning-fast scores for every game, every week\n• Follow every drive with live play-by-play, big plays, turnovers, and momentum swings\n• Instant alerts for scores, red zone trips, close games and more\n• Track standings, wild card races, and the playoff picture\n• A football scoreboard built for the full slate, with every live game easy to scan\n\nGame Analysis\n• Pregame analysis that shows what could decide the matchup\n• See which quarterback has the edge and why\n• Trench battles, X-factors, and pressure points that can swing the game\n• Win probabilities, injury context, and weather impact before kickoff\n• Game recaps that capture the biggest moments, key performances, and what comes next\n\nInjuries and Roster News\n• Know who is in, who is out, and which injuries could change Sunday\n• See how injuries shift each matchup before kickoff\n• Depth chart changes and late-breaking roster updates\n\nStats and Box Scores\n• NFL player stats, game logs, career numbers, and season leaders\n• Box scores that bring every drive, score, and stat into focus\n• League leaders for passing, rushing, receiving, defense, and kicking\n• Postgame stats and recaps that show how each game was decided\n\nOdds and Line Context\n• See what's driving the moneyline, spread, and total\n• Market movement, confidence signals, key drivers, and risk factors\n• Line context with the injuries, matchups, and risks behind each number\n• Compare full-game and first-half lines to see where the game could tilt\n\nSchedules, Standings and Team News\n• Latest news for every team\n• TV listings for every game\n• Full season schedule: filter by week, team, division, or conference\n• Everything for your team: news, schedules, stats, and roster updates\n\nMost football apps tell you what happened. Superfan Sports helps you follow what is happening live and understand what could happen next.\n\nThis is football for superfans.\n\nDownload now.\n\nPlease note:\nThis app is not endorsed by or affiliated with the National Football League. Any trademarks used in the app are done so under \"fair use\" with the sole purpose of identifying the respective entities, and remain the property of their respective owners. All projections, analysis, recommendations, and statistics are for informational purposes only and do not constitute financial or betting advice. We make no guarantees regarding the accuracy of predictions or outcomes. Please gamble responsibly and only where permitted by law.\n\nSuperfan Sports Privacy Policy: https://www.superfansports.com/privacy\nSuperfan Sports Terms and Conditions: https://www.superfansports.com/terms", "minimumOsVersion":"16.6", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.819720000000000226236807066015899181365966796875, "sellerUrl":"https://www.superfansports.com", "bundleId":"com.sportsscheduleapp.scores.football.nfl", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "ES"], "fileSizeBytes":"215407616", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":8914, "trackContentRating":"12+", "trackCensoredName":"Superfan Sports: NFL Football", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/superfan-sports-nfl-football/id1237698160?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"12+", "averageUserRating":4.819720000000000226236807066015899181365966796875, "userRatingCount":8914}]
